  {
   "etapa": "explicar",
   "piezas": [
    {
     "tipo": "explicacion",
     "titulo": "Routine verbs",
     "texto": [
      "Learn these verbs with their meanings: **просыпаться** (to wake up), **умываться** (to wash one's face) and **одеваться** (to get dressed). In **встречаться**, the action is mutual: **мы встречаемся** means «we meet up» or «we see each other»."
     ],
     "tutora": ""
    },
    {
     "tipo": "explicacion",
     "titulo": "Comparison and the genitive",
     "texto": [
      "**Быстрее меня** means «faster than me»: after the comparative, **меня** is the genitive of **я**. You can also say **быстрее, чем я**. In **после школы**, **школы** is the genitive after **после**."
     ],
     "tutora": ""
    }
   ]
  },
